  "notes": [
    "These small, selected ecommerce task samples show specific improvements, ties and losses; they do not establish a consistent quality, speed or cost advantage.",
    "The 18 library comparisons are the revised supplied-evidence, backend and simulated-service browser protocol, not the originally proposed full live end-to-end protocol.",
    "Skill reads are observed trace events, not proof of influence. No observed read is not proof that the description had no effect.",
    "One infrastructure-interrupted attempt (two arms) was excluded from outcomes and retained in the internal spend record; four earlier diagnostic runs are outside this primary matrix.",
    "Two cases per model in each library lane; repeated scenarios are not additional independent task types. No human comparison was conducted.",
    "Further validation uses isolated experimental candidates and different tasks, rubrics and invocation conditions; do not pool it with library or historical scores. Neither experimental batch passed its registered publication gate.",
